{"comment": "alice challenges bob, carol and dave to hearts; all accept. The deal comes from the game's random seed, so each hand is a placeholder; a reused placeholder must take the same value. The opening hand_started event says hand 1 passes left, and every seat chooses its three cards at once. bob, carol and dave resign in turn: a seat that leaves is played for, and cannot win; alice, the last one left, wins."}
